  "_ed25519_kat_comment": "RFC 8032 §7.1 Test 1 — deterministic Ed25519 KAT. Each runner re-derives the public key from the seed, signs the (empty) message, and asserts the signature equals the spec value byte-for-byte. Defends against subtle wrapper bugs (wrong DER framing, swapped endianness, etc.).",
  "ed25519_kat": {
